  "title": "Mom&#39;s Fresh Cranberry-Pumpkin Bread",
  "description": "Mom&#39;s fresh cranberry-pumpkin bread recipe includes fresh cranberries and canned pumpkin. It&#39;s sweet and tart and tastes great warm or at room temp.",
